<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Theory> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Socioemotional selectivity theory" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "SST" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "socio-emotional selectivity theory" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "time-horizon theory of motivation" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/theories-of-ageing> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Laura Carstensen's lifespan theory that people's goals depend on how much time they feel they have left: when the future seems open, they favour exploration and new information; when it feels limited, they prioritise emotionally meaningful relationships and experiences." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/adversity-and-mortality> .
