  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socioemotional-selectivity-theory> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/socioemotional-selectivity-theory/s3> .
