  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/view-from-above> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "cosmic perspective exercise" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/view-from-above> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "looking down from above" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/view-from-above> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "view from above" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/view-from-above> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/spiritual-exercises> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/view-from-above> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Stoic reflective exercise of imagining yourself raised high above the earth, and stretched across time, so that a present worry, ambition or grievance is seen at its true scale within the whole of human life." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/view-from-above> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/emotions-and-equanimity> .
