<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "When I call someone wise, am I responding to their judgment and care for others, or mainly to their intelligence, confidence or age?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Whose advice am I about to rely on here, and what picture of wisdom made me choose them?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Would someone raised with a different idea of wisdom see this choice as wise, and what would they weigh that I am leaving out?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/implicit-theories-of-wisdom> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
