  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/virtue-ethics> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#supportedBy> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/eavesdropping-on-character-study> .
}

<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is this decision actually within my power, and is the outcome really uncertain, or am I deliberating to put off accepting something?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I checked that the goal itself is a good one, not just how to reach it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Did I consider more than one way forward before settling on the first idea I had?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is my confidence here earned by long, well-fed-back experience, or is it just a strong feeling?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I set a point where thinking stops and acting starts?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/check/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Rewrite> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#after> "Is this really my call, and what am I trying to achieve: her success, or a quieter team? Let me list the options, including a coaching plan with a review date, talk it over with HR and her previous lead, and decide by Thursday." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#before> "My gut says she's not cut out for this. I'll announce the move on Monday and be done with it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#situation> "A manager has to decide within a week whether to move a struggling analyst to a different team or keep coaching her in her current role." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#why> "The wiser response clarifies the goal, widens the options and borrows others' judgment on an important, uncertain matter, but still commits to a decision on time instead of drifting." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/1> <https://schema.org/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/1> <https://schema.org/text> "Check that the matter is actually up to you and that its outcome is genuinely uncertain; if not, stop deliberating and either accept it or act on what is known." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/2> <https://schema.org/position> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/2> <https://schema.org/text> "Say plainly what you are trying to achieve, and ask whether that end is worth pursuing before you plan how to reach it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/3> <https://schema.org/position> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/3> <https://schema.org/text> "List at least two or three realistic ways of getting there, not just the first one that occurred to you." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/4> <https://schema.org/position> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/4> <https://schema.org/text> "For the most promising option, trace backwards from the goal to the very next thing you would have to do, and drop options whose chain hits something impossible." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/5> <https://schema.org/position> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/5> <https://schema.org/text> "If the decision is important, talk it through with someone who knows this kind of situation." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/6> <https://schema.org/position> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/6> <https://schema.org/text> "Before trusting a strong gut feeling, ask whether you have had long, well-fed-back experience with situations like this one." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowToStep> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/7> <https://schema.org/position> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/7> <https://schema.org/text> "Set a point at which deliberation ends, then choose and act promptly, without reopening the question unless new facts appear." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/HowTo> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/name> "Deliberation" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/4> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/5> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/6> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto> <https://schema.org/step> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation/howto/7> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Skill> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Deliberation" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "bouleusis" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "deliberating well" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "euboulia" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "good deliberation" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/practical-wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The capacity to think a choice through before acting: working out, for something that is up to you and whose outcome is uncertain, which available course will best reach a worthwhile end, and then settling on it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/judgment-and-decisions> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Deliberation" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/intellectual-humility> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/rumination> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/deliberation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/seeking-counsel> .
