<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I treating \"not deciding\" as if it were not itself a choice?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I assuming the person I'll be in ten years wants exactly what I want today?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Which part of this can I learn about before committing, and which part can I only learn by living it?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Rewrite> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#after> "I can't know now what teaching will feel like, and staying is a choice too. I'll test what I can (shadow a class, ask two teachers what surprised them), decide what I'd want to have tried, and set a date." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#before> "I'll wait until I'm sure I'll be happier as a teacher. Until then, staying put is the safe choice." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#situation> "After eight years in a stable accounting job, Priya has an offer to retrain as a teacher at lower pay, and has been going back and forth for months." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#why> "Waiting for a certainty that can't arrive quietly chooses the status quo, which the evidence suggests people over-favour; gathering what is knowable and naming the real reasons is the wiser path." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Context> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Major life decisions" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "big life choice" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "crossroads decision" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "life-changing decision" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "major life decision" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/decisions-under-uncertainty> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The rare, high-stakes choices that reshape a life — whether to change career, move, start or end a relationship, or have a child — where the outcome is uncertain, hard to undo, and may change the very person who lives with it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/major-life-decision> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/judgment-and-decisions> .
