  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/purpose-in-life> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A lasting, central aim that organises a person's goals and daily choices, feels personally meaningful and, on most accounts, reaches beyond the self; psychologists treat it as one facet of meaning in life and a predictor, though not a proven cause, of better health and longer survival." .
