  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/three-dimensional-wisdom-model> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/psychology-of-wisdom> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/three-dimensional-wisdom-model> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Monika Ardelt's model of personal wisdom as the integration of three personality qualities: a cognitive desire to understand life deeply, a reflective habit of seeing events and oneself from many perspectives, and compassionate concern for others; it is measured by the self-report Three-Dimensional Wisdom Scale (3D-WS)." .
