<https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself#graph> {
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "What would someone who knows me well say about me here that I would rather not hear?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Am I judging myself by my intentions while others can only see my behaviour?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Have I mistaken a confident story about my motives for real knowledge of them?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/check/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Rewrite> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#after> "I don't experience myself that way, but two people saw the same thing. I'll ask a colleague to watch the next meeting and tell me what they notice." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#before> "That's not me. I know how I come across, and I'm a good listener." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#situation> "After a project review, a manager is told by two team members that her meetings run long because she rarely lets others finish a point." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself/example> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#why> "Self-views are least reliable on flattering or unflattering traits, so treating others' observations as evidence rather than an attack is how the maxim is actually followed." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-11-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#Principle> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Know thyself" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "gnothi seauton" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "gnōthi seauton" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "know yourself" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "the Delphic injunction" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "the Delphic maxim" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-knowledge> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The ancient Greek maxim inscribed at Apollo's temple at Delphi, read first as a reminder of human limits and later, through Socrates and Plato, as a call to examine one's own character, beliefs and ignorance; modern psychology adds that this is best done with the help of other people's views." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/scheme/self-knowledge> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Know thyself" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/doctrine-of-the-mean> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/intellectual-humility> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/introspection-illusion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-reflection> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/socratic-ignorance> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/know-thyself/s1> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/know-thyself/s2> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/know-thyself/s3> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/know-thyself> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/know-thyself/s4> .
