  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/self-distancing/s5> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/source/self-distancing/s6> .
