  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#addresses> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/solomons-paradox> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#appliedIn> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/interpersonal-conflict> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#contrastsWith> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/distraction> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#develops> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/wise-reasoning> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/self-distancing> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/ontology#domain> "self-knowledge" .
