  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/hubris> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/humble-leadership> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/hubris> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/intellectual-arrogance> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/hubris> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/wisdom-graph/id/intellectual-humility> .
